## 📊 Key Features

### ✅ Automated Database Management
- MongoDB Memory Server creates isolated test database
- Automatic connection retry with exponential backoff
- Clean database state for each test
- Automatic cleanup after tests complete

### ✅ Comprehensive Assertions
- Response structure validation
- HTTP status code verification
- Database state verification
- Error message validation

### ✅ Proper Error Handling
- 5 retry attempts for server startup
- Exponential backoff (2s → 4s → 6s → 8s → 10s)
- Clear error messages for debugging
- Non-blocking email service failures

### ✅ ES Module Support
- All files use ES6 import/export
- Consistent with backend module system
- No CommonJS conflicts
- Future-proof syntax

### ✅ Test Isolation
- No external dependencies
- No database port conflicts
- Parallel test execution ready
- Database cleanup between tests

