## 📞 Support & Troubleshooting

### Common Issues & Solutions

**Issue**: Tests timeout
**Solution**: Run with `--timeout 60000` flag

**Issue**: MongoDB Memory Server fails
**Solution**: Check disk space, restart tests

**Issue**: Module import errors
**Solution**: Run `npm install`, verify Node version

**Issue**: Tests pass locally but fail in CI/CD
**Solution**: Check Node version in CI matches locally

